        "pf_1fddd33b_value": "The seed for Nature’s Path was planted way back in the 1930s when Arran Stephens was growing up on his family’s second-generation organic berry farm. Arran’s father taught him how to care for and nurture the soil, telling him to “always leave the earth better than you found it”. These words have been woven into the very fabric of Nature’s Path.",
        "pf_beed753d_value": "Ever wonder what to do with granola? A lot of people use it as a breakfast cereal, or on top of yogurt, but there are many additional ways in which granola can be used. Check out the ideas below for some inspiration on how to enjoy granola for breakfast, lunch, dinner, dessert and snack!",
        "pf_a999ee85_value": "The health benefits will vary depending on the ingredients, but this beloved breakfast food is a healthy and delicious snack. These ingredients are full of fiber and good fats, making granola a nutrient-dense food. Here are some of the ways eating granola can benefit your health",
        "pf_502f2c56_value": "Baked with the goodness of oats, almonds, cashews, pumpkin seeds, sunflower seeds and honey, this fiber-rich breakfast is perfect for your healthy and active lifestyle. It makes for the perfect post-workout meal, where every bit is as tasty as it is healthy.",
        "pf_798d756f_value": "Living 'healthily ever after' is just an 'add to cart' away. Make the healthy switch to live an active lifestyle effortlessly and stay all good, always. Your taste buds will thank you for this breakfast option that's as crunchy &amp; tasty as it is healthy.",
        "pf_6376bdea_value": "I just wanted to say that I have fallen in love with your foods. I got my large order today and was very impressed with the packaging and the quality of my meals. It was soooo good!! Looking forward to being a regular customer from now on!!",
        "pf_ee281a7e_value": "I was nice enough to share it with my friends. Of course they all agrees how good it is! Just fell in love with the kale chips! Can’t wait to try more!! So glad we are coming back next week and I can’t wait to try your other products!! ",
        "pf_21f8a930_value": "Tried the ready to eat taco on a whim today while grocery shopping. First bite in I knew I had to go back and get a few more for the weekend. Outstanding!!! I wanted to write and personally thank you for starting this company!",
        "pf_ec4c3d88_value": "Read actual testimonials from happy, healthy clients of Crunchy. We are grateful for our customers &amp; the transformations they have because of our natural food products. See for yourself the difference Crunchy has made!",
